4
00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.249
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Is it OK now?

5
00:00:27.643 --> 00:00:29.539
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Yes, fine now!

6
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:34.349
