10
00:00:44.271 --> 00:00:46.213
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> What’s your first name?

11
00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.201
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Micaela.

12
00:00:49.202 --> 00:00:50.643
