13
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:58.032
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> M-I-C-A-E-L-A.

14
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:04.298
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> M-I-C-A-E-L-A

15
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.665
– is that right?

16
00:01:07.439 --> 00:01:09.259
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

17
00:01:10.063 --> 00:01:12.931
