20
00:01:20.972 --> 00:01:26.949
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> No, it’s V-A-Z-Q-U-E-Z.

21
00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:34.945
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> V-A-Z-Q-U-E-Z.

22
00:01:35.324 --> 00:01:41.120
OK. Er How old are you, Micaela?

23
00:01:42.015 --> 00:01:43.563
