35
00:02:29.351 --> 00:02:37.756
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Ah yes. It’s C- one zero zero five A-A-C.

36
00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:46.798
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> C- one zero zero five A-A-C.

37
00:02:47.496 --> 00:02:51.047
