45
00:03:35.925 --> 00:03:47.577
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Plus five four, one one, one five, eight nine three four, five five six eight.

46
00:03:48.062 --> 00:03:51.248
Great. And your landline?

47
00:03:52.189 --> 00:04:02.233
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> Plus five four, one one, six zero two three, five four four two.

48
00:04:04.812 --> 00:04:13.187
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> Plus five four, one one, six zero two three, five four four two.

49
00:04:13.444 --> 00:04:14.871
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> That’s right.

50
00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:20.378
<v><b>Teacher:</b></v> OK, that’s great. So, what do you do, Micaela?

51
00:04:21.046 --> 00:04:25.112
<v><b>Micaela:</b></v> I’m at university. I’m a medical student…